 "about": [
  "Melissa A. Hailey is a founding partner of Hailey | Hart PLLC, a women-owned and operated civil litigation firm in Denver. Melissa represents plaintiffs in state and federal courts in matters involving serious personal injury and first-party insurance disputes. She handles motor vehicle collisions, injuries from defective products and dangerous conditions, and litigation against large insurers who fail to benefits owed on homeowners, commercial property, disability, and underinsured motorist claims. Melissa keeps a small caseload to provide superior client service and achieve excellent results. She is dedicated to promoting integrity in the legal profession and is routinely credited by her peers as a top attorney in the areas of plaintiffs' personal injury and insurance law."
